<p class="lesson-lead">Two weeks between Thanksgiving and Winter Break building the boss fight on your own: reusing elements already in the game (<code>EnemyController</code>, <code>TurretController</code>, projectiles, <code>Platform</code>, <code>Spawner</code>, <code>StatManager</code>) across brainstorming, prototyping, self-playtesting, friend playtesting, and revising.</p>

<h2>Lessons</h2>
<table>
    <tr><th>ID</th><th>Title</th><th>What you build / learn</th></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/8.1.html">8.1</a></td><td>Boss Design: Reuse &amp; Brainstorm</td><td>three divergent ideas remixing existing parts; pick one scope</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/8.2.html">8.2</a></td><td>Boss Prototype I: Arena, Body &amp; Health</td><td>greybox arena + boss body using <code>ChangeHealth()</code> and phases</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/8.3.html">8.3</a></td><td>Boss Prototype II: Player Attacks &amp; Hitbox</td><td>melee (<code>attackBox</code>, <code>KeyCode.E</code>) &amp; ranged (<code>PlayerProjectile</code>) hits</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/8.4.html">8.4</a></td><td>Boss Prototype III: Patterns &amp; Reused Hazards</td><td>turrets, platforms, spawners, Phase 2 waves &amp; self-playtest</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/8.5.html">8.5</a></td><td>Boss Playtest with Friends &amp; Win/Lose Loop</td><td>blind friend playtest notes + victory drop &amp; <code>StatManager.Die()</code> reset</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href="../../lessons/8.6.html">8.6</a></td><td>Boss Revisions &amp; Pre-Break Showcase</td><td>top revisions, verification re-test, freeze &amp; showcase before break</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Concepts this unit owns</h2>
<p>Every semester pattern converges: state machines (<a href="../unit-04/enemy-state-machines.html">Unit 4</a>), cooldowns, events, the singleton — and the semester's real final: a playable game and a student who can explain it. CED: AAP-1/2/3 together, CRD-2 (design docs as code-adjacent artifacts).</p>

